  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\">You can’t.&nbsp; There’s no longer a link between an amount of stake on a <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-validator-node\"><strong id=\"\">validator</strong></a> and a particular account.&nbsp; If knowing such a thing is important to you, and you participate in activities other than staking which result in you acquiring <a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-liquid-stake-unit-lsu-and-native-liquid-staking\"><strong id=\"\">Liquid Stake Units</strong></a>, you’ll have to reconstruct that information from your transaction history, use separate accounts, or take advantage of a service which does it for you.</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Further Reading:</strong></p><ul id=\"\"><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/start-here-radix-staking-introduction\"><strong id=\"\">Start Here! Radix Staking Introduction</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-does-staking-work-on-radix\"><strong id=\"\">How does staking work on Radix?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-do-xrd-emissions-work\"><strong id=\"\">How do XRD emissions work?</strong></a></li></ul><p id=\"\">‍</p>",
